@{
    ViewBag.Title = "About Us - FilmDiaries";
}

@section Styles {
    <link href="~/Content/css/user_about_us.css" rel="stylesheet" />
}

    <!-- about us ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- -->
    <section class="about-us">
        <h1 class="anabaslik">About Us</h1>
        <div class="sections">
            <div class="section1">
            <div class="left-side">
                <h1>Who Are We?</h1>
                <p>We are a team of five university students who came together with one shared goal: 
                to turn our ideas into something fun, creative, and useful. As part of our Web Programming project, 
                we wanted to build more than just a website, we wanted to create a place where people can 
                discover stories, explore new worlds, and enjoy their favorite entertainment. By combining our ideas, 
                learning new skills, and working together, we are turning our vision into reality, one line of code 
                at a time!</p>
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sections">
            <div class="section2">
            <div class="right-side">
                <h1>What Is Our Website About?</h1>
                <p>Our website is an online entertainment platform where movie and series lovers can explore 
                    a variety of content and find something perfect for their next movie night. Users can 
                    discover different genres, search for their favorite titles, and rent or purchase the 
                    movies and series they want to watch. With an easy-to-use interface and a variety of 
                    entertainment options, our platform aims to make finding your next favorite story simple 
                    and enjoyable. Whether you're looking for action, comedy, romance, or a little mystery, 
                    your next adventure starts here!</p>
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sections">
            <div class="section3">
            <div class="left-side">
                <h1>Why Did We Created This Website?</h1>
                <p>We created this website as part of our Web Programming course to put our knowledge 
                    into practice and turn what we've learned into a real, working project. Our goal 
                    was to build a user-friendly platform where people can easily explore, rent, and 
                    purchase movies and series. Throughout this project, we aim to improve our programming 
                    skills, learn how to design and develop a website, and experience what it's like to work 
                    together as a team. More than just a university assignment, this project is an 
                    opportunity for us to turn our ideas into something creative, practical, and enjoyable 
                    for movie lovers!</p>
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
